  41:Drivers/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../misc/lv_bidi_private.h **** /**
  42:Drivers/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../misc/lv_bidi_private.h ****  * Auto-detect the base direction of a text by scanning all strong characters.
  43:Drivers/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../misc/lv_bidi_private.h ****  * RTL takes priority: if any RTL strong character is found, `LV_BASE_DIR_RTL` is returned
  44:Drivers/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../misc/lv_bidi_private.h ****  * immediately. Otherwise, `LV_BASE_DIR_LTR` is returned if any LTR strong character is found.
  45:Drivers/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../misc/lv_bidi_private.h ****  * If no strong character is present, falls back to `LV_BIDI_BASE_DIR_DEF`. When
  46:Drivers/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../misc/lv_bidi_private.h ****  * `LV_BIDI_BASE_DIR_DEF` is `LV_BASE_DIR_AUTO`, this function returns `LV_BASE_DIR_LTR`.
  47:Drivers/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../misc/lv_bidi_private.h ****  * @param txt the text to process
  48:Drivers/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../misc/lv_bidi_private.h ****  * @return `LV_BASE_DIR_LTR` or `LV_BASE_DIR_RTL`
  49:Drivers/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../misc/lv_bidi_private.h ****  */
  50:Drivers/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../misc/lv_bidi_private.h **** lv_base_dir_t lv_bidi_detect_base_dir(const char * txt);
