  55:Drivers/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../misc/lv_bidi_private.h ****  * @param bidi_txt internally the text is bidi processed which buffer can be get here.
  56:Drivers/lvgl/src/widgets/label/../../misc/lv_bidi_private.h ****  * If not required anymore has to freed with `lv_free()`
